Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same car,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.76,0:00:01.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,same wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,One at thirty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:02.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,miles an hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:03.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,one at forty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:04.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Only ten faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:05.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,but look how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:05.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,much deeper the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:06.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,front crushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:07.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Crash energy grows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:08.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the square
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:09.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,of your speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.45,0:00:09.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,So ten more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:10.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,miles an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:12.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,means\Nseventy-eight percent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:12.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,more energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:13.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,And every bit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:13.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,of it has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:14.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,to go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,These steel rails
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:15.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,fold like an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:16.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,accordion and turn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:17.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,it into bent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:18.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,metal and heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,At thirty, they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:20.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,crush about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:20.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,twenty inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:21.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,At forty,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:22.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,nearly twenty-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:23.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Almost all the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:23.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,way to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:23.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:24.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hitting a wall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:25.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,at thirty is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:26.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,like falling off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:27.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,a three-story building.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:28.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,At forty, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:29.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,a five-story fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:30.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even with braking:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.57,0:00:30.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,where the slower
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:31.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,car stops, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:32.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,faster one is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:33.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,still doing thirty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:34.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same driver,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:35.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,same brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:36.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ten miles an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:36.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,hour is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,whole difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:38.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,So in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:39.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,those ten aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:40.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,a little faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:41.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,They're almost twice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:41.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,the crash.
